exports[`email catalog > integration-error > matches html and text snapshots > subject 1`] = `"Action needed: Jira connection error"`;

exports[`email catalog > integration-error > matches html and text snapshots > text 1`] = `
"MeetOps

Hi Ana,

MeetOps can't reach Jira for Acme Inc. Approved tasks won't sync until the connection is fixed.

Reason: The access token was revoked.
Failing since 26 Oct 2026, 9:00 PM IST

Fix connection: https://app.meetops.test/settings/integrations

--
You're receiving this because of your MeetOps notification settings.
Manage email preferences: https://app.meetops.test/settings/notifications
Unsubscribe: https://app.meetops.test/u/one-click?t=demo
"
`;

