exports[`email catalog > password-reset > matches html and text snapshots > text 1`] = `
"MeetOps

Hi Ana,

We received a request to reset the password for your MeetOps account.

Reset password: https://app.meetops.test/reset-password?token=demo

This link expires in 30 minutes and can be used once.

If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email. Your password won't change.

--
You're receiving this security email because of activity on your MeetOps account. It can't be turned off.
"
`;

